  {"type":"text","id":"foot","x":60,"y":648,"width":1400,"height":44,"text":"Write latency is the distance from the left edge to the orange tick. Write-behind wins it by acking before the data is durable —\nthe red span is the window in which a Redis failure loses those writes outright. That is the entire trade, drawn to scale.","originalText":"Write latency is the distance from the left edge to the orange tick. Write-behind wins it by acking before the data is durable —\nthe red span is the window in which a Redis failure loses those writes outright. That is the entire trade, drawn to scale.","fontSize":14,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#64748b","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":300075,"version":1,"versionNonce":300076,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.25}
